  <text>The authors declare no competing interests.</text>
  <heading level="2">Peer review</heading>
  <heading level="3">Peer review information</heading>
  <italic>Nature</italic>
thanks Yunan Luo, Martin Steinegger and the other, anonymous, reviewer for their contribution to the peer review of this work.
Peer reviewer reports
are available.
  <heading level="2">Additional information</heading>
  <bold><![CDATA[Publisher's note]]></bold>
